RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    httr2,
    curl,
    jsonlite,
    rvest
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    askpass,
    keyring
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/distintivelab/seiapir
